      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite:generateContent",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"contents\": [{\n    \"parts\": [{\n      \"text\": {{ JSON.stringify(\n        \"You are writing a re-engagement email to a dormant real estate lead who went cold months ago. Write a message that gives them a REAL reason to reply, not a checking in message.\\n\\nBUYER: \" + $json.lead_name +\n        \"\\nORIGINAL INTEREST: \" + $json.original_config + \" in \" + $json.original_area + \" for \" + $json.original_budget +\n        \"\\nWHY THEY WENT COLD: \" + $json.notes +\n        \"\\n\\nCURRENT MARKET INTELLIGENCE:\\n\" +\n        \"Price movement: \" + ($json.market_parsed && $json.market_parsed.price_movement ? $json.market_parsed.price_movement : 'stable') +\n        \"\\nNew launches: \" + ($json.market_parsed && $json.market_parsed.new_launches ? JSON.stringify($json.market_parsed.new_launches) : '[]') +\n        \"\\nNotable changes: \" + ($json.market_parsed && $json.market_parsed.notable_changes ? $json.market_parsed.notable_changes : 'None reported') +\n        \"\\nOpportunity hook: \" + ($json.market_parsed && $json.market_parsed.opportunity_hook ? $json.market_parsed.opportunity_hook : 'None') +\n        \"\\n\\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object with these exact keys. No markdown fences. No prose. Just the raw JSON starting with { and ending with }.\\n\\nRequired JSON keys:\\n\" +\n        \"- subject_line: compelling specific mentions the area or a real change NOT 'Just checking in' or 'Following up'\\n\" +\n        \"- email_body_html: a fully designed HTML email, 120-180 words of actual copy, in Indian English, addresses buyer by first name only, references specific original criteria, delivers ONE most relevant piece of market news, ends with ONE soft ask, signs off as Team GoaNest Realty. Built exactly to the STRUCTURE below.\\n\" +\n        \"- key_hook: one line summarising what makes this message worth replying to\\n\\n\" +\n        \"STRUCTURE for email_body_html (all CSS must be INLINE style attributes on every tag, no <style> tags, no external CSS, no <div> layout, since email clients strip both and Outlook needs tables. NO clickable buttons or links anywhere, this is a read-only informational email):\\n\" +\n        \"1. Outer wrapper: a <table role='presentation' width='100%' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' style='background-color:#f5f3ee;padding:24px 0;'> containing a centered inner <table role='presentation' width='600' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' style='max-width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e8e4d9;'>.\\n\" +\n        \"2. Header row: a <td> with style='background-color:#eef3ee;padding:22px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #c9a86a;' containing 'GoaNest Realty' in a warm charcoal color (#3f4a3f), bold, font-size:19px, letter-spacing:0.5px. No dark or saturated background, this should feel light and airy.\\n\" +\n        \"3. Body row: <td style='padding:28px 32px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#4a4a45;'>. Greet buyer by first name in a warm, slightly larger opening line (font-size:16px, color:#3f4a3f). 2-3 short paragraphs, never walls of text.\\n\" +\n        \"4. Highlight box: inside the body, ONE soft, soothing block using a nested <table width='100%'><tr><td style='background-color:#faf6ea;border-left:3px solid #c9a86a;border-radius:4px;padding:14px 16px;margin:16px 0;font-size:14px;color:#5c5340;'> containing ONLY the single most relevant market fact or number, phrased calmly not urgently.\\n\" +\n        \"5. Closing line: a plain text sentence (not a button, not a link) delivering the soft ask, styled inline as <p style='font-size:15px;color:#4a4a45;margin-top:18px;'>, e.g. 'Do let us know if you would like the updated listing details.'\\n\" +\n        \"6. Footer row: <td style='padding:18px 30px;background-color:#f5f3ee;font-size:12px;color:#9a9488;text-align:center;'> with 'Team GoaNest Realty' and a one-line tagline.\\n\" +\n        \"Overall palette must feel calm and soothing: soft sage green (#eef3ee, #3f4a3f), warm cream/beige (#faf6ea, #f5f3ee), and a muted gold accent (#c9a86a) only for thin borders, never large color blocks or dark backgrounds. Avoid deep greens, blacks, or bright colors entirely.\\n\" +\n        \"Do not use <p> tags as the only structure. Do not use <style> blocks, <div> based layout, or any <a href> tags or button elements. Every element must carry its own inline style attribute.\\n\\n\" +\n        \"RULES: Never use em-dashes. Never say 'just checking in' or 'reaching out again'. Never mention they went cold. Reference their specific budget and config. Return raw JSON only.\"\n      ) }}\n    }]\n  }],\n  \"generationConfig\": {\n    \"temperature\": 0.7,\n    \"maxOutputTokens\": 4096,\n    \"responseMimeType\": \"application/json\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
